en:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0080010b30'>
//「聞けい。
//　我が娘よ。我が孫よ」
"Heed me, my daughters."

//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0080020b30'>
//「これより村正鍛冶の<RUBY text='みち'>法</RUBY>を告げる」
"The time has come to reveal our Way."

//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md01/0080030a15'>
//「うむ」
"Yes, Father."

//【村正】
<voice name='村正' class='村正さん' src='voice/md01/0080040a01'>
//「はい」
"We're ready."

//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0080050b30'>
//「劒冑とは武の器。
//　戦のためのもの」
"Tsurugi are weapons, vessels of might forged for war."

//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0080060b30'>
//「ゆえにまず、戦を<RUBY text='み'>鑑</RUBY>る。
//　戦とは如何なるものなのか――」
"Therefore, we must first understand the nature of war."

//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md01/0080070a15'>
//「……」
"......"

//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0080080b30'>
//「善の働きに非ず！
//　正義の顕れに非ず！」
"War is not the struggle of good versus evil! It is not an exercise in honor or justice!"

//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0080090b30'>
//「戦とは<RUBY text='ワレ'>我</RUBY>の<RUBY text='のぞみ'>愛</RUBY>を求めて<RUBY text='カレ'>彼</RUBY>の愛を壊す<RUBY text='おこない'>行為</RUBY>。
//　武とはその暴力」
"War is the act of destroying another's Love to satisfy your own. Might is the instrument of this self-righteous perversion."

//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0080100b30'>
//「独善なり！
//　これこそが悪!!」
"Self-righteousness! That is our enemy!"

//【村正】
<voice name='村正' class='村正さん' src='voice/md01/0080110a01'>
//「――――」
"......"

//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md01/0080120a15'>
//「……では？」
"So..."

//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0080130b30'>
//「我ら村正は戦を滅ぼす。
//　戦の悪を人々に知らしめ、戦を人の世から
//去らしめる！」
"We will eradicate war from the earth. Wherever we go, men will learn the horror of conflict and lay down their swords."

//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0080140b30'>
//「武にただ加担するのではなく、
//　武を制するための劒冑を打つ!!」
"Thus we will be not mere vessels of might, but the end of might itself!"

//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md01/0080150a15'>
//「それが御父の行き着いた答なのだな」
"Is that the answer you have sought for so long?"

//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0080160b30'>
//「そうだ」
"It is."

//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md01/0080170a15'>
//「ならば、信ずる！
//　<RUBY text='あれ'>吾</RUBY>は御父の定めた道に従い、後を継ごうぞ」
"Then so be it! If that is the path you would have me follow, then follow it I shall!"

//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md01/0080180a15'>
//「吾の後は、こやつが継ぐ！」
"And my daughter shall do the same!"

//【村正】
<voice name='村正' class='村正さん' src='voice/md01/0080190a01'>
//「は……はい！」
"Y- Yes, Mother!"

//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md01/0080200a15'>
//「御父は心置きなく、鍛造に掛かるが良い」
"You may commit your soul to the forge with no regrets, Father, knowing that your legacy is safe in our hands."

//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0080210b30'>
//「うむ。
//　だが、うてだけではない。なれも鍛えよ」
"Well said. However, I will not be going to the forge alone. You shall come with me."

//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md01/0080220a15'>
//「む、それは？
//　劒冑を二領、献上するということか？」
"What do you mean? Are we to offer two tsurugi?"

//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0080230b30'>
//「そうだ。但し一方にではない。
//　南朝と北朝に、一領ずつ」
"Yes, but not only to Yoshino. One tsurugi for the South, one for the North."

//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0080240b30'>
//「両陣の武を共に抑えねば、乱は治められぬ」
"This war will not end unless both courts' might is brought to heel."

//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md01/0080250a15'>
//「道理だ」
"Of course."

//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0080260b30'>
//「否やはあるまいな？」
"I trust that you have no objections?"

//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md01/0080270a15'>
//「無論！
//　御父の理想を体現する劒冑と成ることこそ、
//吾が宿望であった」
"None! It is my destiny, and indeed my desire, to shed the flesh in service of your dream."

//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md01/0080280a15'>
//「後顧の憂いもない。
//　こやつには既に、全ての技を伝えてある」
"My duties in this life are complete. My daughter has learned all the skills I have to teach."

//【村正】
<voice name='村正' class='村正さん' src='voice/md01/0080290a01'>
//「……」
"......"

//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md01/0080300a15'>
//「明日より早速、鍛造に掛かろうぞ」
"Let us begin the forging with the rising of the sun."

//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md01/0080310a15'>
//「御父の望みが、劒冑をもって人の心中の刃
//を砕くにあると知ったからには……
//　その望み、必ずや吾が果たす！」
"Together, we shall pursue your dream―until the last self-righteous blade has been shattered and peace reigns across the land!"

//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0080320b30'>
//「うむ……！」
"Indeed!"
